    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bite, biting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				623a1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήξιες σπλάγχνων</span>”
				<i>gnawings,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of mental anguish, <i>pangs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.51
			</span></i> (pl.), Chrysipp.ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; also, <i>biting jokes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
